A: <p>internet explorer 5 &amp; 6 don't support <code>&gt;</code>,<code>+</code> and <code>[attr]</code> selector. More information at <a href="http://www.quirksmode.org/css/contents.html" rel="nofollow">http://www.quirksmode.org/css/contents.html</a></p>


